---
description: FE i18n — EN + JA message catalogs, no hardcoded user strings
globs: apps/web/messages/**,apps/web/app/**/*.{ts,tsx},apps/web/features/**/*.{ts,tsx},apps/web/shared/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# I18N (mandatory)

- User-facing strings in **English and Japanese**
- Avoid hardcoded UI copy in components/pages (except rare technical labels)
- Catalogs: `apps/web/messages/en.json`, `apps/web/messages/ja.json`, `vi.json` if used
- Stable keys: e.g. `auth.login.title`, `users.table.empty`
- Keep `<html lang="...">` in sync with active locale
